"Mishu, a great green bear, was the ancient Forest Empress of the Ash Forest, now gone."
"Mishu was so powerful that even the Azure Emperor dared not challenge her for the Ash Forest."
"All Blaze Bears shared a solstice vision of the Great Mother's death, years before the war."
"Later, demon hornets clip Blaze Bears' back-fur so they cannot ignite."
"At the coming war's peak, hornets annex about 100 Blaze Bear territories a day."
"Later, Paobu flees the fall of Home and takes refuge at Fa Ram."
"Later, Huishou leads the surviving Blaze Bears in alliance with Bi De against the hornets."
"Later, the Blazing Forest Sect forms: Sect Master Yi Baolin of Shady Glade and Huishou's bears."
"The Blazing Forest Sect goes on the tax rolls with 121 members, over 100 of them Blaze Bears."
